+### Axiom accounting
+
+Running Lean with `#print axioms Proof.final` produced exactly:
+
+`'Proof.final' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]`
+
+There is no `sorryAx`. There is also no dependency on any of the 47 generated
