+| 8 | 32–34 | `rule-02406fd68a82c2913a2b54042cfc3145ed95db3409554a09fc0a8d1b6cf799f4` | guarded `valSeqAt(intVals(IS), I) = intAt(IS, I)` | `DOMAIN_LEMMA` |
